---
manual: app.top_level_is_flow
lines: [855, 857]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 480 do
  @a = button "A", width: 200
  @b = button "B", width: 200
  @c = button "C", width: 200
end
----------- test code
a, b, c = %w[@a @b @c].map { |name| layout_of(button(name)) }

assert_in_delta a.y, b.y, 0.5, "two 200-pixel buttons fit on a 480-pixel row"
assert_in_delta a.x, c.x, 0.5, "the third does not, so it wraps to the left edge"
assert_operator c.y, :>=, a.y + a.h - 0.5, "on the next row"
